WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.484 --> 00:00:19.084
O beautiful for spacious skies,
For amber waves of grain,

00:00:19.104 --> 00:00:36.624
For purple mountain majesties
Above the fruited plain!

00:00:36.624 --> 00:01:03.424
America! America! God shed His grace on thee,
And crown thy good with brotherhood

00:01:03.424 --> 00:01:14.864
From sea to shining sea! America!

00:01:14.864 --> 00:01:35.584
O beautiful for heroes proved In liberating
strife,

00:01:35.584 --> 00:01:53.104
Who more than self their country loved,
And mercy more than life!

00:01:53.104 --> 00:02:10.704
America! America! God mend thine every flaw,

00:02:10.704 --> 00:02:25.104
Confirm thy soul in self-control, 
Thy liberty in law!

00:02:25.104 --> 00:02:33.504
O Beautiful, America. O Beautiful,

00:02:33.504 --> 00:02:44.624
America!

00:02:44.664 --> 00:03:00.224
O Beautiful for patriot dream
That sees beyond the years

00:03:00.224 --> 00:03:15.984
Thine alabaster cities gleam,
Undimmed by human tears!

00:03:16.024 --> 00:03:32.144
America! America! God shed His grace on thee,

00:03:32.144 --> 00:03:47.944
Till selfish gain no longer stain 
The banner of the free!

00:03:47.944 --> 00:03:59.424
America!

